{"id": "EUVD-2026-80770", "enisaUuid": "5bb17516-d06e-3f82-994f-f593990e502e", "description": "A BIND resolver encountering an SVCB/HTTPS AliasMode record referencing 14 or more SVCB/HTTPS ServiceMode records may fail to properly deallocate internal resources. If this happens repeatedly, resource exhaustion will eventually prevent the resolver from performing new recursive lookups.\nThis issue affects BIND 9 versions 9.18.0 through 9.18.50, 9.20.0 through 9.20.27, 9.21.0 through 9.21.25, 9.18.11-S1 through 9.18.50-S1, and 9.20.9-S1 through 9.20.27-S1.", "datePublished": "2026-09-16T14:00:04", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-17T17:47:23", "baseScore": 7.5, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H", "references": ["https://kb.isc.org/docs/cve-2026-81563", "https://downloads.isc.org/isc/bind9/9.20.29", "https://downloads.isc.org/isc/bind9/9.21.26"], "aliases": ["GHSA-vrwj-p746-fr2r", "CVE-2026-81563"], "assigner": "isc", "epss": 0.57, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "5853eb01-e4c4-345d-a201-93420f2d56a5", "product": {"name": "BIND 9", "vendor": {"name": "ISC"}}, "product_version": "9.21.0 \u22649.21.25"}, {"id": "7b4b3039-3114-3886-bb68-1aa29644d4ef", "product": {"name": "BIND 9", "vendor": {"name": "ISC"}}, "product_version": "9.18.0 \u22649.18.50"}, {"id": "86f38759-17b0-3259-ad79-f3d4e8dc01d0", "product": {"name": "BIND 9", "vendor": {"name": "ISC"}}, "product_version": "9.20.9-S1 \u22649.20.27-S1"}, {"id": "8b85119c-5407-30be-b893-4c1d52200c17", "product": {"name": "BIND 9", "vendor": {"name": "ISC"}}, "product_version": "9.18.11-S1 \u22649.18.50-S1"}, {"id": "f65677e3-8d06-3c72-a203-8b84ebc6a9c7", "product": {"name": "BIND 9", "vendor": {"name": "ISC"}}, "product_version": "9.20.0 \u22649.20.27"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "b9c4d5e4-8cf2-3049-ac0c-42aa0d2370a0", "vendor": {"name": "ISC"}}], "isExploited": false}